  "notable_quotes": [
    "MAF-4 and MAF-7 have similar pore volumes (~0.67 cm3 g−1) and BET areas (~1870 m2 g−1), much higher than the most open inorganic zeolites.",
    "In MAF-47-x solid-solution frameworks, lowering pore-surface active-site density decreases H2O affinity, reducing initial isotherm slopes and shifting inflection to higher humidity.",
    "MAF-7, SOD-[Zn(mtz)2], is isomorphous with MAF-4 and has nearly identical pore metrics: 11.2 Å cavity, 3.4 Å window, and 51.7% void."
